<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.unbound.lists ~ the documents a mint left unbound, named and kept

`lares vessel unbound` asks the standing vessel's `unbound-docs` verb for every minted document no binding names and prints the list as JSON. It removes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ list the unbound documents`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ runs on this host's own vessel root; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ verb-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-refused` params=`cure/[[engine.unbound.lists]] ~ the daemon refused the read, or no vessel answers; stand it and read again`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 ~ the unbound documents as a JSON array`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/2 ~ the daemon's refusal on stderr`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

